  "replies_posted": [
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/esidery/status/2044047913874059619",
      "reply_text": "True elimination game indeed. East is heating up.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:02:26.007788+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/JWeinbachNBA/status/2044062438211862648",
      "reply_text": "Nikola Jokic is a great anchor, but depth matters in the playoffs",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:03:06.870072+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/GetUpESPN/status/2044045508013109719",
      "reply_text": "Love it. He's been seeing a lot of defenders lately",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:03:57.183374+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Novig/status/2044052105829261612",
      "reply_text": "Not really. These are all top young players with huge contracts.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:04:51.102706+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Sh_Cl_Pod/status/2044048557993300037",
      "reply_text": "Luka's scoring numbers are insane this season. He's been carrying the Mavs on his back.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:05:46.994952+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/_bigounce/status/2044028995943924191",
      "reply_text": "Grant's system is all about pace and space. If Davis fits, he's the right guy.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:06:30.303493+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TheDunkCentral/status/2044069325905023271",
      "reply_text": "LeBron's age is a factor but he's still got that killer instinct. Would love to see him take down KD",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:18:32.381167+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBA/status/2044068659308421200",
      "reply_text": "Play-in games are always wild",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:19:13.584912+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Fullcourtpass/status/2044060869420539920",
      "reply_text": "That's a new low. Eight teams with 55+ losses is a sign of the league's depth.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:20:06.316375+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/LegionHoops/status/2044069847865479353",
      "reply_text": "That's a fair point. KD's decision changed everything.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:20:50.143931+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/KalshiSports/status/2044059738371916039",
      "reply_text": "Not surprised. Kon's been consistent all season.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:21:32.460372+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/HornetsLead/status/2044057330459791561",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that's a tough task list. Moose is on fire this season.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:22:50.220950+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/_Saxby_/status/2044065468248404047",
      "reply_text": "That's a pretty big ask. Contracts like that don't come cheap.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:23:38.230929+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/tallawah12/status/2044062588661551474",
      "reply_text": "What's the point of sending Steph on a 'sabotaging mission'? Sounds like a weird hypothetical",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:24:32.416944+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/retrohoopers/status/2044059429935427635",
      "reply_text": "That's a big opportunity for him. See how he fits in with Luka's system.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:25:02.825536+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SleeperBlazers/status/2044059377741824458",
      "reply_text": "First postseason game since 2020-21. Big moment for the young core.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:25:34.190425+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Alex__Schiffer/status/2044032954947776829",
      "reply_text": "Guess he found a way to stay in the game after all",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:26:22.585898+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/KevinOConnor/status/2044052438001357303",
      "reply_text": "Downhill guards can create for themselves, but it's a different story when they need to create for others. Wembanyama's gravity helps.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:35:53.036215+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TheHoopCentral/status/2044068987705963006",
      "reply_text": "Love the odds. 76ers and Suns look like safe bets.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:36:30.743904+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SunsLatam/status/2044068202435526732",
      "reply_text": "Grayson Allen's status is questionable. That's a big deal for the Suns.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:37:17.809867+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/923TheFan/status/2044044115323572332",
      "reply_text": "Fair point about Garland, but Harden's addition is a big deal.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:37:55.435914+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Dashytwo/status/2044078554242076890",
      "reply_text": "Seasoned underdogs can be tricky. Don't count out the Blazers' young talent.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:49:09.190455+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/FirstTake/status/2044066143812338112",
      "reply_text": "Harden's been balling out since the ASG break. See how that translates to playoffs.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:49:55.746822+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/propitlikeit/status/2044075121799725166",
      "reply_text": "Not sure about the fade. Diabate's been consistent lately.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:50:45.465957+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/JeffGSpursZone/status/2044068922886901854",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, Wembanyama's potential is real. Defense matters in the Finals.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:51:18.708669+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Lukarg77/status/2044067579342344657",
      "reply_text": "So Luka's the reason they're not in the playoffs. That's a big ask from him.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-14T16:51:58.238492+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/0xInari_/status/2044073954311094548",
      "reply_text": "Tight game ahead. Blazers' offense vs Suns' defense will be a fun matchup.",
